{"ref":"BDB, שָׁאוּל","hw":"שָׁאוּל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁאוּל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>= <em>asked</em> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל</a> infr.; Palm. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שאילא</span> Lzb<sup>371</sup> Cooke<sup>283</sup><strong>)</strong>;—Σαουλ:<br><strong>1.</strong>  <sub>397</sub> 1st king of Isr., <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.2\">1 S 9:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.3\">3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.5\">5</a> (son of Kish, a Benjamite) + 359 times Sm, 28 times 1 Chr, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:1\" href=\"/Psalms.18.1\">ψ 18:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:2\" href=\"/Psalms.52.2\">52:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 54:2\" href=\"/Psalms.54.2\">54:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:1\" href=\"/Psalms.57.1\">57:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:1\" href=\"/Psalms.59.1\">59:1</a> (all in titles); <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.29\">Is 10:29</a> (and <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.4\">1 S 11:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.34\">15:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.6\">2 S 21:6</a> v. II. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גִּבְעָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_גִּבְעָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעָה</a>).<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  a king of Edom <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:37\" href=\"/Genesis.36.37\">Gn 36:37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:38\" href=\"/Genesis.36.38\">38</a> (P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:48\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.48\">1 Ch 1:48</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:49\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.49\">49</a>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  a son of Simeon <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:10\" href=\"/Genesis.46.10\">Gn 46:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:15\" href=\"/Exodus.6.15\">Ex 6:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:13\" href=\"/Numbers.26.13\">Nu 26:13</a> (all P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.24\">1 Ch 4:24</a>.<br>†<strong>4.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.9\">1 Ch 6:9</a>.","next":"BDB, שָֽׁאוּלִי","prev":"BDB, שְׁאָל"}